---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout
	title="Applications & Solved NCERT Proofs | Triangles | Class 10 | The Concepts Adda"
	description="Apply BPT and similarity criteria to solve trapeziums, diagonals, and exam-focused NCERT geometric proofs for Class 10 Mathematics."
>
	<main class="lesson-page">
		<div class="lesson-container">
			<a href="/triangles" class="back-link">
				<span class="back-arrow">←</span>
				<span>Back to Triangles</span>
			</a>

			<!-- LESSON HEADER -->
			<section class="lesson-header">
				<div class="lesson-number">03</div>
				<div class="lesson-header-copy">
					<div class="lesson-label">LESSON 03 · CLASS 10 MATHEMATICS (NCERT)</div>
					<h1>Applications & Solved <span>Proofs</span></h1>
					<p>
						Apply BPT and similarity criteria (AA, SAS, SSS) to solve trapezium problems, diagonal ratios, and NCERT exam questions.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- CONTENT LAYOUT -->
			<section class="content-layout">
				<article class="lesson-content">

					<!-- 01 · TRAPEZIUM DIAGONALS PROOF -->
					<div class="topic-label">01 · TRAPEZIUM PROOF</div>
					<h2>Diagonals of a Trapezium</h2>
					<p>
						A classic NCERT problem involves proving the ratio of segments formed by intersecting diagonals in a trapezium:
					</p>

					<div class="example-card">
						<div class="example-header">
							<span class="example-badge">PROOF 1</span>
							<h3>ABCD is a trapezium with AB ∥ DC. Diagonals AC and BD intersect at O. Prove AO / OC = BO / OD.</h3>
						</div>
						<div class="example-solution">
							<p><strong>Proof using Similarity:</strong></p>
							<p>Consider △AOB and △COD:</p>
							<p>1. ∠AOB = ∠COD (Vertically opposite angles)</p>
							<p>2. ∠OAB = ∠OCD (Alternate interior angles since AB ∥ DC)</p>
							<div class="calc-box">
								By AA similarity criterion, <strong>△AOB ~ △COD</strong>.<br/>
								Therefore, ratio of corresponding sides is equal:<br/>
								AO / CO = BO / DO ⟹ <strong>AO / OC = BO / OD (Proved)</strong>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- 02 · LADDER / WALL SIMILARITY -->
					<div class="topic-label second-label">02 · NCERT EXERCISES</div>
					<h2>Step-by-Step Geometry Problems</h2>

					<div class="example-card">
						<div class="example-header">
							<span class="example-badge">EXAMPLE 2</span>
							<h3>In △ABC, DE ∥ BC with AD = 1.5 cm, DB = 3 cm, AE = 1 cm. Find EC.</h3>
						</div>
						<div class="example-solution">
							<p>Since DE ∥ BC, by <strong>Basic Proportionality Theorem (BPT)</strong>:</p>
							<div class="calc-box">
								AD / DB = AE / EC<br/>
								1.5 / 3 = 1 / EC<br/>
								1 / 2 = 1 / EC ⟹ <strong>EC = 2 cm</strong>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- 03 · QUICK SUMMARY -->
					<div class="topic-label second-label">03 · QUICK SUMMARY</div>
					<h2>Key Takeaways</h2>

					<div class="summary-list">
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>01</span>
							<p>In trapeziums (AB ∥ DC), triangles formed by intersecting diagonals are <strong>similar</strong> (△AOB ~ △COD).</p>
						</div>
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>02</span>
							<p>Whenever a line is parallel to one side of a triangle, immediately apply <strong>BPT (AD/DB = AE/EC)</strong>.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>03</span>
							<p>Always write down <strong>Given, To Prove, Construction, and Proof</strong> clearly in exam answers!</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- LESSON NAVIGATION -->
					<div class="lesson-navigation">
						<a href="/triangles/basic-proportionality-theorem" class="previous-lesson">
							<span>←</span>
							<div>
								<small>PREVIOUS LESSON</small>
								<strong>Basic Proportionality Theorem</strong>
							</div>
						</a>

						<a href="/triangles/pyqs" class="next-lesson">
							<div>
								<small>NEXT LESSON</small>
								<strong>Previous Year PYQs</strong>
							</div>
							<span>→</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- SIDEBAR -->
				<aside class="lesson-sidebar">
					<div class="sidebar-card">
						<div class="sidebar-title">TRIANGLES</div>
						<div class="progress-text">Lesson 03 of 04</div>
						<div class="progress-bar">
							<div style="width: 75%;"></div>
						</div>

						<div class="sidebar-lessons">
							<a href="/triangles/similar-figures-criteria" class="sidebar-lesson">
								<span>01</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Similar Figures & Criteria</strong>
									<small>AAA, SSS & SAS rules</small>
								</div>
							</a>

							<a href="/triangles/basic-proportionality-theorem" class="sidebar-lesson">
								<span>02</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Basic Proportionality Theorem</strong>
									<small>BPT / Thales Theorem proof</small>
								</div>
							</a>

							<a href="/triangles/applications-and-proofs" class="sidebar-lesson active">
								<span>03</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Applications & Proofs</strong>
									<small>NCERT geometric proofs</small>
								</div>
							</a>

							<a href="/triangles/pyqs" class="sidebar-lesson">
								<span>04</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Previous Year PYQs</strong>
									<small>CBSE 2020-2024 practice set</small>
								</div>
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</aside>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>

	<style>
		.lesson-page {
			min-height: 100vh;
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fbff 0%, #ffffff 35%, #f7f9fc 100%);
			color: #14213d;
			padding: 45px 0 100px;
		}

		.lesson-container {
			width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
			margin: 0 auto;
		}

		.back-link {
			display: inline-flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 7px;
			color: #667085;
			text-decoration: none;
			font-size: 14px;
			font-weight: 700;
			margin-bottom: 35px;
			transition: color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
		}

		.back-link:hover {
			color: #2563eb;
			transform: translateX(-3px);
		}

		.lesson-header {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr);
			gap: 25px;
			align-items: center;
			padding: 40px;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			border-radius: 24px;
			background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
			box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.055);
			margin-bottom: 45px;
		}

		.lesson-number {
			width: 80px;
			height: 80px;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			border-radius: 20px;
			background: #eef4ff;
			color: #2563eb;
			font-size: 23px;
			font-weight: 900;
		}

		.lesson-label {
			color: #2563eb;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 850;
			letter-spacing: 1.7px;
			margin-bottom: 10px;
		}

		.lesson-header h1 {
			margin: 0;
			font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 54px);
			line-height: 1.05;
			letter-spacing: -2px;
			font-weight: 900;
			color: #14213d;
		}

		.lesson-header h1 span {
			color: #2563eb;
		}

		.lesson-header p {
			margin: 15px 0 0;
			max-width: 720px;
			color: #687180;
			font-size: 17px;
			line-height: 1.65;
		}

		.content-layout {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 300px;
			gap: 45px;
			align-items: start;
		}

		.lesson-content {
			min-width: 0;
			padding: 5px 0 0;
		}

		.topic-label {
			color: #2563eb;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 900;
			letter-spacing: 1.8px;
			margin-bottom: 14px;
		}

		.second-label {
			margin-top: 60px;
		}

		.lesson-content h2 {
			margin: 0;
			color: #14213d;
			font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 38px);
			line-height: 1.1;
			letter-spacing: -1.5px;
			font-weight: 900;
		}

		.lesson-content > p {
			max-width: 780px;
			margin: 18px 0 0;
			color: #687180;
			font-size: 16.5px;
			line-height: 1.75;
		}

		.example-card {
			margin-top: 25px;
			border-radius: 20px;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			background: #ffffff;
			box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.035);
			overflow: hidden;
		}

		.example-header {
			padding: 20px 24px;
			background: #f8fafc;
			border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
		}

		.example-badge {
			display: inline-block;
			padding: 4px 12px;
			border-radius: 6px;
			background: #2563eb;
			color: #ffffff;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 900;
			letter-spacing: 1px;
			margin-bottom: 8px;
		}

		.example-header h3 {
			margin: 0;
			font-size: 18px;
			font-weight: 800;
			color: #14213d;
		}

		.example-solution {
			padding: 24px;
			color: #475569;
			font-size: 15px;
			line-height: 1.7;
		}

		.calc-box {
			margin-top: 10px;
			padding: 14px 18px;
			border-radius: 12px;
			background: #0f172a;
			color: #38bdf8;
			font-weight: 700;
			font-size: 15px;
			font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
		}

		.summary-list {
			display: grid;
			gap: 16px;
			margin-top: 26px;
		}

		.summary-item {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 20px;
			padding: 20px 24px;
			border-radius: 16px;
			background: #ffffff;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.03);
		}

		.summary-item span {
			padding: 8px 14px;
			border-radius: 10px;
			background: #eef4ff;
			color: #2563eb;
			font-weight: 900;
			font-size: 13px;
			flex-shrink: 0;
		}

		.summary-item p {
			margin: 0;
			color: #334155;
			font-size: 15.5px;
			line-height: 1.5;
			font-weight: 600;
		}

		.lesson-navigation {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: space-between;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 20px;
			margin-top: 60px;
			padding-top: 40px;
			border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
		}

		.previous-lesson,
		.next-lesson {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 16px;
			padding: 18px 24px;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			border-radius: 16px;
			background: #ffffff;
			text-decoration: none;
			color: #14213d;
			transition: all 0.2s ease;
		}

		.next-lesson {
			margin-left: auto;
			text-align: right;
			justify-content: flex-end;
		}

		.previous-lesson:hover,
		.next-lesson:hover {
			border-color: #2563eb;
			box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
			transform: translateY(-2px);
		}

		.previous-lesson div,
		.next-lesson div {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.previous-lesson small,
		.next-lesson small {
			display: block;
			color: #64748b;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 700;
			letter-spacing: 1px;
			margin-bottom: 4px;
		}

		.previous-lesson strong,
		.next-lesson strong {
			display: block;
			font-size: 15px;
			font-weight: 600;
			color: #0f172a;
		}

		.previous-lesson span,
		.next-lesson span {
			font-size: 20px;
			color: #2563eb;
			font-weight: 800;
		}

		.lesson-sidebar {
			position: sticky;
			top: 30px;
		}

		.sidebar-card {
			padding: 28px;
			border-radius: 24px;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			background: #ffffff;
			box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.04);
		}

		.sidebar-title {
			color: #2563eb;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 900;
			letter-spacing: 1.5px;
			margin-bottom: 8px;
		}

		.progress-text {
			color: #64748b;
			font-size: 13px;
			font-weight: 700;
			margin-bottom: 12px;
		}

		.progress-bar {
			height: 6px;
			border-radius: 10px;
			background: #e2e8f0;
			overflow: hidden;
			margin-bottom: 24px;
		}

		.progress-bar div {
			height: 100%;
			background: #2563eb;
			border-radius: 10px;
		}

		.sidebar-lessons {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 8px;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson {
			display: flex;
			align-items: flex-start;
			gap: 12px;
			padding: 12px;
			border-radius: 12px;
			text-decoration: none;
			color: #334155;
			transition: background 0.15s ease;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson:hover {
			background: #f8fafc;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson.active {
			background: #eef4ff;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson > span {
			width: 24px;
			height: 24px;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			flex-shrink: 0;
			border-radius: 6px;
			background: #f1f5f9;
			color: #64748b;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 700;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson.active > span {
			background: #dbeafe;
			color: #2563eb;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson div {
			min-width: 0;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson strong {
			display: block;
			font-size: 13px;
			font-weight: 600;
			color: #1e293b;
			line-height: 1.3;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson.active strong {
			color: #1d4ed8;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson small {
			display: block;
			font-size: 11px;
			color: #64748b;
			margin-top: 3px;
			line-height: 1.3;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson.active small {
			color: #3b82f6;
		}

		@media (max-width: 900px) {
			.content-layout {
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}

			.lesson-header {
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				padding: 28px;
			}

			.lesson-number {
				width: 60px;
				height: 60px;
				font-size: 18px;
			}

			.lesson-navigation {
				flex-direction: column;
			}

			.next-lesson {
				width: 100%;
			}
		}
	</style>
</Layout>
